      "evidence": "**Evidence for \"Gone\"**\n- Publication has ended. Every surviving copy is frozen at its August 2025 state.\n- Archivist Frank Donnelly expects the snapshot to stay current for only \"the next couple of years,\" after which it becomes mainly historical.\n\n**Background issues** (these would have been Moderate or High even before the shutdown)\n- Users long complained about outdated records, points with no real location (coordinates 0,0), and missing unique IDs and attributes (HIFLD Next; Nate Smith on LinkedIn, July 2025).\n- After the crosswalk vanished, users must pull from many separate sources again, with mixed update schedules.\n\n**Rating: Gone.**\n\n---"
